---
title: Child's Pose Stretch
type: docs
prev: docs/rastyazhka/
---
![растяжка в позе ребенка](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/723bf4be-339c-491a-b33f-519942dcbd49)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Get onto all fours on your hands and knees, reaching your hands out on the floor in front of you.

### Step 2
Shift your hips back and down to sit on your heels, letting your hands slide forward along the floor to gently stretch your back and shoulders.

### Step 3
Once your hips are resting back toward your heels, reach your arms out comfortably in front of you and rest your forehead on the floor. Relax your whole body.

### Step 4
Hold the stretch for the recommended amount of time (usually 20–30 seconds) or repeat for the desired number of reps.

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Breathe slowly and steadily—never hold your breath.

• Move smoothly into the pose without forcing or straining your muscles.
{{< /callout >}}
